{"cantica":"paradiso","cantoNumber":5,"title":"Canto V","totalDuration":394.099,"segments":[{"id":8,"speaker":"beatrice","text":"If I blaze before you with a love's intensity\nbeyond what earthly eyes have ever witnessed,\noverwhelming the strength of your own sight,\ndo not wonder at this—\nit comes from perfect vision that perceives the good\nand moves toward what it has recognized.\nI see clearly how eternal light\nalready shines within your understanding,\nthat light which, once seen, kindles love forever.\nIf anything else seduces your heart,\nit is only a trace of this same light,\nmisunderstood, glimmering through the darkness.\nYou want to know whether some other service\ncan compensate for a broken vow enough\nto shield the soul from judgment's claim.","startTime":0,"endTime":47.44,"words":[{"word":"If","start":0,"end":0.32},{"word":"I","start":0.32,"end":0.56},{"word":"blaze","start":0.56,"end":1.28},{"word":"before","start":1.28,"end":1.6},{"word":"you","start":1.6,"end":1.84},{"word":"with","start":1.84,"end":2.08},{"word":"a","start":2.08,"end":2.24},{"word":"love's","start":2.24,"end":2.64},{"word":"intensity","start":2.64,"end":3.6},{"word":"beyond","start":3.6,"end":4.24},{"word":"what","start":4.24,"end":4.48},{"word":"earthly","start":4.48,"end":5.04},{"word":"eyes","start":5.04,"end":5.52},{"word":"have","start":5.52,"end":5.76},{"word":"ever","start":5.76,"end":6.08},{"word":"witnessed,","start":6.08,"end":7.16},{"word":"overwhelming","start":7.16,"end":7.92},{"word":"the","start":7.92,"end":8.08},{"word":"strength","start":8.08,"end":8.64},{"word":"of","start":8.64,"end":8.84},{"word":"your","start":8.84,"end":9.04},{"word":"own","start":9.04,"end":9.36},{"word":"sight,","start":9.36,"end":10.24},{"word":"do","start":10.24,"end":10.4},{"word":"not","start":10.4,"end":10.72},{"word":"wonder","start":10.72,"end":11.12},{"word":"at","start":11.12,"end":11.28},{"word":"this—","start":11.28,"end":12.16},{"word":"it","start":12.16,"end":12.32},{"word"